  "body": "## Summary\n- Land the Hub tree that the pinned Jankurai 1.6.11 `--full` auditor scores **92** (raw 92, empty `caps_applied`, 0 hard findings) without lowering `AUDIT_FLOOR` / `minimum_score`.\n- Local `bash scripts/ci-local.sh required` passed on committed `ae5f54b` (security, fast 580, lint, contract 219, docs). This GitHub snapshot is that tree minus `.github/workflows` because the available OAuth token has no `workflow` scope.\n- The snapshot is based on current GitHub `main` (`109ec83`) so the PR has shared history. It does **not** keep the published demo-gif / readme-live-media bytes from that snapshot; those remain on other lanes and must not be mixed into this Jankurai landing.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `jankurai audit` 1.6.11 `--full --fail-under 90 --fail-on critical --fail-on high` \u2192 92 / caps [] / hard 0\n- [x] `bash scripts/ci-local.sh required` \u2192 PASS\n- [ ] Hosted required checks on this PR (empty if workflows stay absent, same as git/portal/kernel)\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)",
